  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello. My device is (Samsung Galaxy A34 5G, 6GB RAM). I have serious problems in the mobile version of VRChat, after the latest updates. When I walk through different worlds, I see strange blue and green artifacts on the screen and everything flickers, wrong textures. I tried clearing the cache, resetting the game settings, and reinstalling the game, but nothing helps. I had to download an older version of VRchat Mobile \"2024.3.3p1-1519-0ac487c87b-Release\" released on October 16. It works more correctly for me and there are no such errors. I talked to my friends who have weaker devices, they checked VRChat Mobile and they did not have such problems.",
